error: a generator over a type without bounds makes a Domain, written `{x in T, conditions}`
  --> tests/errors/domains.lion:7:23
   |
 7 | let doubled = {x * 2, x in Int, x > 0}
   |                       ^^^^^^^^
   |
   = a Domain holds the values of its variable that satisfy the conditions; it has one generator, whose values are the result (§16.5, C74)
